  "answer": {
    "text": "To get a sales team to log activities, stop relying on manual data entry and instead automate call and email syncing through your CRM integrations.\nWhen you remove the administrative burden from reps, data accuracy goes up and compliance follows. Here is a step-by-step framework to solve the problem permanently.\n1. Automate the Capture (Remove Manual Work)\nSales reps hate logging data because they view it as non-selling busywork. Fix this by connecting tools so logging happens in the background.\n2. Standardize the Process\nIf manual input is still required for certain notes, make the entry fields simple, mandatory, and uniform.\n3. Track and Coach (Don't Police)",
